e that unite tranquillity and profundity diffuse over souls whose innocence gives them a right to an unmingled and exclusive enjoyment of nature . None but crimeless and unimpassioned minds ever truly enjoyed earth , ocean , and heaven . At our first transgression , nature expels us , as it did our first parents , from her paradise for ever .
